      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cg",
      "action": "hide"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "露營那一夜。天色晴。會長拿著激光筆講冬季星空。獵戶座。參宿四。腰帶三星。冬季大三角。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "不在場的，除了還在跟火鍋耗著的寶方和阿俊，就是不知何時不見了的家綸和綺珊。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "suting",
      "expr": "05-spring",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "喂，凌晨，怎麼不見了家綸呢？知不知道他在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "04-cold",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "哈，不用管那小子。也許他正在幹他的人生大事呢！"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "ajun",
      "expr": "03-nosy",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ajun",
      "text": "人生大事？你是指上洗手間嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "text": "會長還在講獵人奧瑞恩和毒蠍。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "ajun"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "suting",
      "expr": "04-tears",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "我們用不用去找一找家綸了？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "05-fire",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "不用了。他只不過行開一會兒，很快便會回來。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "suting",
      "expr": "01-smile",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "但是，萬一他發生了甚麼意外呢？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "他可以打電話。那小子硬漢一條，死不了的。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "suting",
      "expr": "02-sigh",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "不過，凌晨啊，這兒晚上漆黑一片，他迷了路怎麼回來。不如去找一找他吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "01-shrug",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "不用了呀，他有手電筒。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "suting",
      "expr": "03-worry",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "但是……"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "suting"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "lingchen",
      "expr": "02-blush",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "lingchen",
      "text": "我說不用擔心就不用擔心了。是他自己叫我們不用找他的。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "hide",
      "id": "lingchen"
    },
    {
      "kind": "actor",
      "action": "show",
      "id": "suting",
      "expr": "05-spring",
      "position": "near"
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "suting",
      "text": "是嗎？真的叫我們不用找他？為甚麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "kind": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "守著答應家綸的秘密",
          "jump": "ch10-keep"
        },
        {
          "text": "說出家綸在向綺珊表白",
          "jump": "ch10-spill"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
